	<h3><u>Hussain ya hussain</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Hussain ya hussain</u></strong></p>

<p>Hussain ya hussain x6</p>

<p>1. (Beta hu mein ali ka, nawasa rasul ka) x2</p>

<p>zainab behen hai meri, chahita butul ka,</p>

<p>kurbaniya ye meri bhulayi na jayengi,</p>

<p>jab karbala basengi sadayen ye ayengi</p>

<p>hussain ya hussain,</p>

<p>hussain be kafan,</p>

<p>hussain be khataa,</p>

<p>hussain shah x4</p>

<p>2. baaba ali ke hatho men jo zulfikaar hai,</p>

<p>mukhsas uski kufri ki naslo pe waar he,</p>

<p>mai jang kyu ki hasan ka mai bhayi hu,</p>

<p>tum munkire khuda mai khuda ka fidayi hun,</p>

<p>hussain ya hussain,</p>

<p>hussain be kafan,</p>

<p>hussain be khataa,</p>

<p>hussain shah x4</p>

<p>3. mere liye rasul ke sajdo me tool hai,</p>

<p>marzi meri khuda ko nabi ko kubulhai,</p>

<p>sukhe gale pe mere jo kanjar chalayenga,</p>

<p>markad me fatema ko ali ko satayenga</p>

<p>hussain ya hussain,</p>

<p>hussain be kafan,</p>

<p>hussain be khataa,</p>

<p>hussain shah x4</p>

<p>4. utra tha aasman se sitara hamera gar,</p>

<p>kahe ki simt dekho to diwar me ho daar,</p>

<p>payasa hu be watan hu gharibud dayaar hu,</p>

<p>zehra ki betiyon ke liyen dil fighar hu,</p>

<p>hussain ya hussain,</p>

<p>hussain be kafan,</p>

<p>hussain be khataa,</p>

<p>hussain shah x4</p>

<p>5. larneka kasar kar ke jo aata watan se dur,</p>

<p>bacho ko saath apne na lata watan se dur,</p>

<p>behne bhi betiyan bhi mere saath saath,</p>

<p>mehmaan karbala me tera hum furat hai</p>

<p>hussain ya hussain,</p>

<p>hussain be kafan,</p>

<p>hussain be khataa,</p>

<p>hussain shah x4</p>

<p>6. chahun to sangrejon se paani nichor du,</p>

<p>daste balaa ke sehra se kausar ko jor dun,</p>

<p>khud se khuda ke hukm se majbur kar liya</p>

<p>pani se apne aap ko lo dur karliya,</p>

<p>hussain ya hussain,</p>

<p>hussain be kafan,</p>

<p>hussain be khataa,</p>

<p>hussain shah x4</p>

<p>7. paani hai meri maa ke meher maan likha huwa,</p>

<p>bacho ko mere phir bhi paani na mil sakaa,</p>

<p>se raab ho rahe hai sutr aur asf bhi,</p>

<p>aale nabi ke hoto pe likhi hai tashnagi,</p>

<p>hussain ya hussain,</p>

<p>hussain be kafan,</p>

<p>hussain be khataa,</p>

<p>hussain shah x4</p>

<p>8. ab mere baad ehle haram dukh uthayenge,</p>

<p>be parda ashkiyan unhe balwe me layenge,</p>

<p>sine pe sone wali tamache jo kayengi,</p>

<p>mujko sadayen dengi chacha bulayengi,</p>

<p>hussain ya hussain,</p>

<p>hussain be kafan,</p>

<p>hussain be khataa,</p>

<p>hussain shah x4</p>
</p>